     3. Spring MVC
     4. Security
     5. Makes Spring Boot plug-and-play

🔄 How it works (Simple) : 

Dependencies (pom.xml)
   ↓
@EnableAutoConfiguration
   ↓
Spring Boot checks classpath
   ↓
Auto-configures required beans

